			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750141001,
					"content": "#{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME}! Thank goodness you're safe. I was so worried.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141002,
					"content": "It sure was thrilling! But, uh... But it's a bit hard to describe, so we'll discuss that later...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141003,
					"content": "You tell Taruka what you saw and heard at the camp...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141004
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141004,
					"content": "Really? You saw Ms. Quilla, but not Lamizana...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141005,
					"content": "Well, they mentioned an air race and a transaction. Paimon doesn't know the details, but it sounds like it's for something that will be used during the race.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141006,
					"content": "Ms. Quilla is a traveling merchant who showed up recently. According to Paran, she deals in a wide variety of goods. Maybe Lamizana purchased something dangerous from her...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141007,
					"content": "I see. So he wants to carry out his dangerous plan during the air race!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141008,
						750141009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141008,
					"content": "What kind of dangerous plan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141010
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141010,
					"content": "I don't know... but I'm sure he's plotting something dangerous!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141011,
					"content": "#Ah, so this is where you are. Wonderful! You must be {NICKNAME}, right? Lamizana tells me that you've tried out the training course and that you did quite well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141012,
						750141013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141012,
					"content": "It wasn't a big deal.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141015
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141015,
					"content": "Here's the situation. The race is about to begin, but the contestant who was supposed to race against Lliwa has pulled out at the last minute.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141016,
					"content": "And well... You know her, Taruka, she's always been extremely competitive, so she won't be happy with winning a freebie...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141017,
					"content": "Then she can pull out too. Which is just as well — I'll go to persuade her to do that right now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141018,
					"content": "W—Wait, we can't do that! She also prepared hard for this race, so isn't the best solution to find someone just as good for her to race against...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141019
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141019,
					"content": "#Is that why you've come to {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141020
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141020,
					"content": "Yes. As long as you participate, we'll be sure to compensate you no matter where you end up in the standings...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141021,
						750141023
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141021,
					"content": "Okay, now you're really looking down on me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141022
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141022,
					"content": "Huh? Oh, you're right... Well, if you end up in a top spot, we'll give you the reward for your ranking and a bonus to boot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141025
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141025,
					"content": "Thanks for agreeing! You'll receive the invitation letter later. I have some other preparations to make, so I probably won't see you until race day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141026,
					"content": "Paran leaves, taking Carrewoof with him...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141027
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141027,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, you agreed because this would give us the chance to investigate up close, right? If anything happens during the race, the contestants would be the first to know.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141028,
						750141029
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141028,
					"content": "I also have a feeling that things aren't as simple as they seem.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141031
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141031,
					"content": "Speaking of which, there was something familiar about Paran's voice. Have we heard it somewhere recently?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141032,
					"content": "He's in charge of all sorts of things here at the flying school. He and Carrewoof are always running around everywhere, so it's actually harder to avoid hearing his voice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141033
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141033,
					"content": "That makes sense! Come to think of it, Paimon seems to have read about something like this in a story...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141034,
					"content": "If someone who blends in with the background commits a crime, people usually won't suspect them because they are so used to their presence.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141035,
					"content": "Hmm... Best not to say that in front of him, though. His family was exiled because some of his family members did something terrible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141036,
					"content": "Lots of people have been using that as an excuse to make things difficult for him... Maybe that's why he's so strict with himself but so considerate of others.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141037,
					"content": "Although he's quite close to Lamizana, I have to admit he's a pretty nice guy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141038,
						750141040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141038,
					"content": "Is Lamizana some kind of pest?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141039
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141039,
					"content": "Even pests are a hundred times cuter than him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141041
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141041,
					"content": "Thanks for telling Paimon that! It would be bad if we hurt him, even if it's by accident. Anyway, about the race...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141042
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141042,
					"content": "#Taruka, you don't have to worry about your sister. {NICKNAME} will look out for her!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141043
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141043,
					"content": "Hmm... I'll be waiting for you guys near the finish line. Lamizana and I should finish first, so I'll watch him like a hawk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141044
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taruka"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141044,
					"content": "Hrrooo?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141045
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141045,
					"content": "#This isn't your time to shine, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}. Just enjoy the show with Paimon this time, alright?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141046
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141046,
					"content": "Wrrah...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141040,
					"content": "It looks like he's got it rough.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141041
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141029,
					"content": "No, I just want the participation prize...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141030
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141030,
					"content": "C'mon, just play along, even if just to make yourself seem a bit cooler!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141031
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141023,
					"content": "Woohoo! A guaranteed participation trophy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141024
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141024,
					"content": "Hey, what happened to your ambition!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141025
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141013,
					"content": "Really? Looking down on me, is he?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141014,
					"content": "No, that's not it! Wait, what would Temach say in this situation... I know! The training course must've held you back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paran"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141009,
					"content": "What's his motive, though?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141010
					]
				}
			]
		},
