			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750141320,
					"content": "Paimon was so worried that she broke out in a cold sweat! Good thing she hid, or else that lady would have caught Paimon instead of paying attention to you two Saurians!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141321,
					"content": "You escaped without us...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141322,
					"content": "Wrroo...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141323,
					"content": "Any slower, and this would have become an impossible crime...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141324,
					"content": "Wrroo...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141325,
					"content": "Sure, no one can accuse the Iktomisaur... Well, you, but don't say scary stuff like that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141326,
					"content": "A—Anyway, Paimon was just making adjustments to the plan on the fly! You wouldn't have been able to get away if she hadn't caused a commotion outside.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141327,
					"content": "Sure was lucky that the box was filled with Saurus Crackers. The Iktomisaurs swarmed all over them after the box was knocked over. It was pandemonium!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141328,
					"content": "But Paimon didn't see Lamizana outside either, or the people who'd taken part in the transaction earlier. Seems like neither one was Lamizana, though. Their voices sounded different.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141329,
					"content": "Hmm... Either way, let's tell Taruka what we saw and heard earlier.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
